MongoDB
-------

ForestWatch uses the Motor/PyMongo drivers to talk to a MongoDB server that
the licensee operates. MongoDB Server is a separate product with its own
license (the licensee chooses the server distribution). This package does
not grant a MongoDB Server license.

Docker Compose (docker-compose.yml, docker/*) pulls mongo:7 as a runtime
image. That image is not original ForestWatch source.


Fonts
-----

frontend/public/index.html loads Manrope, IBM Plex Sans, and IBM Plex Mono
from the Google Fonts CDN at runtime (`fonts.googleapis.com` stylesheet
link). Font files are not vendored in this repository. CSS files only
reference the family names.

  Manrope                       SIL Open Font License (commonly)
  IBM Plex Sans / Mono          SIL Open Font License (commonly)

VERIFY BEFORE DISTRIBUTION. Confirm current Google Fonts / OFL terms.
Offline or air-gapped deployments should vendor the fonts and retain
their OFL notices.


Map tiles (runtime, not vendored)
---------------------------------

IntelligenceMap and MapPage load raster tiles from
`{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org` and include the in-code attribution
"OpenStreetMap contributors". Product-showcase copy states that map tiles
remain third-party. Tiles are not stored in this repository.

VERIFY BEFORE DISTRIBUTION: OpenStreetMap / tile-usage terms are not
stored in this repository.


