Data sources and provider terms
-------------------------------

In-code labels (not a substitute for the provider's current legal text):

  Copernicus Land Monitoring Service / CORINE Land Cover (CLC)
    Bundled file: backend/app/data/gis/romania_corine_simplified.geojson
    Related code: backend/app/services/clms_context_provider.py,
    backend/app/services/gis_loader.py
    In-code label: "Copernicus Land Monitoring Service Terms"

    Repository evidence for the bundled file (collection properties):
      source: "Copernicus Land Monitoring Service"
      version: "2018-Romania-Simplified-v1"
      last_updated: "2024-01-01"
      classification_system: "CORINE Land Cover (CLC)"
      coverage: "Romania"
      crs: "EPSG:4326"
      description: "Simplified Romania land cover zones derived from
        Copernicus/CORINE CLC 2018. Replace this file with the official
        CLC 2018 GeoJSON export for full resolution data."
    gis_loader.py describes the same file as a ~50-polygon approximation
    derived from CORINE CLC 2018. The current file contains 52 Polygon
    features. CLC class codes present include 112, 211, 213, 311, 312,
    321, 322, 323, 511, 512, and 521. Features also carry ForestWatch
    properties (label, land_cover_type, confidence).

    Classification: adapted / derived work based on CLMS information,
    not an unmodified CLMS redistribution.

    Transformations documented in this repository: simplification /
    approximation of CLC 2018-class Romania land-cover zones stored as
    GeoJSON. This repository does not contain a generation script, an
    original CLMS download URL, or a dataset DOI.

    Attribution (adapted / derived product):
      Generated using European Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service
      information. Source product identified in this repository: CORINE
      Land Cover (CLC) 2018, Romania coverage.
      The bundled GeoJSON has been simplified and approximated and is
      not an official full-resolution CLC export.
      ForestWatch is not endorsed by the European Union or Copernicus.
      No dataset DOI is recorded in this repository.

    Bundled in the source tree: yes (simplified GeoJSON).

  NASA FIRMS
    backend/app/modules/ingestion/providers/firms.py
    Label: "NASA FIRMS open data policy"
    Live use requires the licensee's FIRMS_API_KEY. Empty key uses a
    bundled mock dataset that mirrors FIRMS CSV format for development
    (not a live FIRMS extract).
    Bundled: integration code plus mock rows. Live FIRMS data is not
    vendored.
    VERIFY BEFORE DISTRIBUTION: confirm current FIRMS terms for live use.

  Global Forest Watch
    backend/app/modules/ingestion/providers/gfw_integrated_alerts_constants.py
    Label: "Global Forest Watch data policy — attribution required"
    Live use is opt-in (ENABLE_FOREST_DISTURBANCE) and requires GFW_API_KEY.
    Bundled: integration code only. Live GFW alerts are not vendored.
    VERIFY BEFORE DISTRIBUTION: confirm current GFW terms for live use.

  EEA Air Quality
    backend/app/modules/ingestion/providers/eea_air_quality.py
    Label: "EEA standard data policy — free and open for public use"
