    VERIFY BEFORE DISTRIBUTION: confirm current EEA terms for live use.

  Copernicus EMS Rapid Mapping
    backend/app/modules/ingestion/providers/cems_rapid_mapping.py
    Label: "Copernicus data policy — free and open; attribution EMS/EU"
