    Bundled: integration code only.
    VERIFY BEFORE DISTRIBUTION: confirm current CEMS terms for live use.

  EFFIS
    backend/app/modules/ingestion/providers/effis_constants.py
    Label: "Copernicus/EFFIS EU data policy — free and open; attribution required"
